<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch economic indicators week of Sept 2.</title>
<headline>Dutch economic indicators week of Sept 2.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said on Friday it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>GMT----date----indicator------------period---previous</p>
<p>   0730  05/09    cash retail sales    July     June +0.4 pct</p>
<p>   0730  06/09    trade balance	  June     May +Dfl 2.7 bln</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
